{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55287","headline":"柬范丞相质 · 张文伏","name":"柬范丞相质","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"禁秘同依日月光，分宣政拙得遐方。\n半生报国心犹赤，万里筹边鬓已苍。\n却忆西陲夸短驭，曾陪东阁赋长杨。\n迢迢云树今如许，谓朔春深正渺茫。\n（见清戚鹤泉编《三台诗录》卷一。\n张靖龙云：「见清王魏《安洲诗录》卷一。\n」）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张文伏","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_55287.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55287","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}